window.products.push({"id":310126,"name":"KW Collection Square Acrylic Cotton Ball Pads Gauze Swab Holder Organizer Q-tip Dispenser Storage Canister Bathroom Container Flossers Box Case (9.3x3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E2PY+-wGL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPACT STORAGE: Dimension: W 3.7\" x L 9.3\" x H 5.1” (with lid). This canister is a two-tier with 4 separate partitions acrylic storage unit, with one lid. It is capacious to organize varied items: makeup products, makeup brushes, jewelries, office supplies, craft supplies, and other small items. PREMIUM QUALITY: Made of durable Chlorine free plastic; Looks like glass but WILL NOT SHATTER; Easy Care - clean with mild soap and water or wipe clean with a damp cloth.Moreover, its transparent glass like body lets you see what you store inside. It is great for storing and organizing cotton swabs, qtips, cotton balls, ovals and rounds, makeup applicators, makeup brushes and cosmetic sponges, wedges, guest soaps, bath bombs, balls, salts and more. BEATIFUL AND FUNCTIONAL: This clear acrylic apothecary jar combines BEAUTY with organization. The sleek canister provides a decorative accent to your powder room, bathroom vanity, makeup table, craft room and more; The modern design with a removable lid gives you a variety of storage options. EASY TO CLEAN - Each apothecary jar has a removable acrylic lid to keep the little things in it clean. Each apothecary jar has a removable acrylic lid and a wide mouth to make accessing bathroom necessities and accessories simple. The acrylic body requires little maintenance because it is resistant to dust and stains. A quick wash with soapy water is all it needs to be shiny again. MAKING HOME A BETTER SPACE: The fun modern, yet space saving design provides plenty of room for storing a multitude of small essentials; Organize your hair accessories - holds hair ties, clips, elastic bands, bobby pins, bows and more; Use in home office for paperclips, rubber bands, binder clips, and stamps; Versatile and easy to use, it will find a place in many rooms of your home; Great for apartments, condos, dorm rooms, RVs and campers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E2PY+-wGL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KW Collection","source_asin":"B09YDMVXQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YDMVXQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YDMVXQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
