window.products.push({"id":310139,"name":"Thunder Group Steamer Set, 11-1/2 by 14-1/2 by 1/16-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GMEAPPotL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Small Hole 11-Inch Aluminum Steamer with Bottom and Lid (ALST003) is brought to you by Thunder Group. This aluminum steamer comes complete with a bottom pot, two middle perforated stacks and a lid. It features built in handles on the sides of all compartments for safe handling while hot. Each hole in the bottom of the steamer measures one millimeter. For health purposes, steaming is ideal. By avoiding using any fat or oils, food retains its essential properties and will have a cleaner flavor. Perfect for fat-free diets, you can steam a variety of foods such as fish, vegetables, shellfish, and much more, as well as the traditional dim-sum, a highly popular Asian dish. Add some herbs to the steam water; the food will absorb the fragrant flavors of the herbs, enhancing your dish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GMEAPPotL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thunder Group","source_asin":"B08ZYYJYSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZYYJYSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZYYJYSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":310140,"name":"TIDYRITE Premium Ziplock Bag Organizer for Drawer - Ultimate Ziploc Bag Organizer, Baggie Organizer for Any Slider Gallon, Quart, Sandwich, Snack (4 P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MEeHynbDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"NOT INVENTED, BUT PERFECTED - We didn’t invent the organizer. But it was disappointing that existing products all had one or more substantial issues. They don’t fit slider bags. They don’t fit quart bags. They don’t fit some brands. The openings are too big and bags fall out. The openings are too small and difficult to use. They’re not sturdy. They project no elegance. They look cheap and scream mass produced. We discovered tons of issues and corrected them all, with lots of love and passion. HANDCRAFTED WITH LOVE - Built by artisans who are passionate about their craft, not churned out from mass production factories. What you find is a product that is sturdy, well-built, well-polished, and gorgeous. It stands world apart from similar products. It not only makes your kitchen organized but also pretty. You can proudly showcase it in your kitchen knowing that it's in a class of its own. We urge you to compare side by side with any similar products and see for yourself. MESSY TO TIDY IN A FLASH - It’s elegant. It’s easy. And it works (details matter). If you ever wished for a more organized kitchen, then this is a must-have. Gone are the days when your kitchen drawers are dominated by jumbled storage bags and crumbled paper boxes. Your ziplock storage bags will be neatly stored in a beautiful, functional wooden organizer. Find what you want in a flash. Save space, save time, look pretty. MINIMALISTIC DESIGN (with strong magnets) - No locks, no rails, no side loading, no bottom loading (can you imagine?). Nope. You simply load it easily by opening up the top which is normally closed tightly by a strong magnet on one end and a hinge on the other. Not any magnet, but a high end magnet (important distinction) to make sure it doesn't pop during use. But it can be lifted when you meant to open it. AMAZING AMERICAN ASSURANCES - We don’t exist to make a buck. Conceived by passionate American entrepreneurs who are frustrated by what's available on the market. Our ultimate goal is to bring you joy. If you’re not happy, we’re not happy. If it doesn’t fit in your drawer, if you accidentally drop it on the floor and it breaks, if it becomes defective, we’re here to support you. You can get your money back if you’re not happy. We can be reached on virtually all mediums that you communicate on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MEeHynbDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIDYRITE","source_asin":"B0BKQY61K2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKQY61K2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKQY61K2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
