window.products.push({"id":310143,"name":"Bico Lemon Dreams Ceramic Spoon Rest, House Warming Gift, Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rqGfkq5tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"| PREMIUM QUALITY & HEALTHY | Lead & cadmium free high quality ceramic spoon rest. DISHWASHER SAFE. Sturdy and fashionable at the same time, safe for everyone to use! | ORIGINAL DESIGN & ATTRACTIVE GIFT | Large ceramic spoon rest designed by Bico with a smooth and glossy glaze, it can be your perfect choice for both daily household use or hosting grand gatherings for all occasions | ELEVATE YOUR DINING EXPERIENCE | Amaze your guests with an entire collection of your favorite pattern! We have all the basic table tops you need, including bowls, dipping bowls, serving platters, salad plates and dinner plates available for all patterns! You can check them out from our brand store | FUNCTIONAL | STACKABLE size, saves your cupboard space efficiency | ATTRACTIVE GIFT | All our products are packed safely with styrofoam and placed in cardboard boxes, definitely gift box ready and can be a gorgeous gift for your loved ones on special occasions, such as Christmas, birthday, house warming, wedding, easter or other holidays","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rqGfkq5tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bico","source_asin":"B08QM73FND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QM73FND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QM73FND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":310144,"name":"nuLOOM Hesse Checker Weave Seagrass Area Rug, 4' x 6', Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1g57ajsLtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At nuLOOM, we believe that floor coverings and art should not be mutually exclusive. Founded with a desire to break the rules of what is expected from an area rug, nuLOOM was created to fill the void between brilliant design and affordability., The images we display have the most accurate colors possible.Rug Colors, sizes, patterns may vary slightly depending on how your rug is made and the size ordered.Due to different monitor resolutions and lighting you may notice a slight difference in color. Each handmade rug is unique to the artisan who weaved it.These are not considered defects Bunching, Creases and Folded Corners: You may see some creases and bunching in the pile and around the corners when you unroll your new rug. These waves will flatten within 2 -3 weeks as you begin to use your new rug. Use these tricks to help flatten your rug: Back Rolling: Roll the carpet out, then roll it back up reversely with the backside up. Let it sit rolled up reversely for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. Heavy Objects: Lay a piece of heavy furniture or objects on affected areas for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. If the corners are sticking up, curl them back and place heavy objects on affected areas going the opposite way. Heat: Use this technique as a last resort only. Place the rug over a cleared concrete or area like a driveway or sidewalk setting during dry sunny conditions. Allow the rug to be positioned for optimal sunlight as long as possible to give the rug time to absorb the sun's heat for up to 2 hours, but use more time if needed. Blow Dryer: If a large concrete patch with optimal sunlight is not accessible, flip the rug over and use a hair dryer to affected areas to heat up the creases. Always hold the hair dryer 7 to 12 inches away from the rug going side to side on a medium setting, as heat can sometimes cause backing to melt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1g57ajsLtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nuLOOM","source_asin":"B084Q9YBPV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084Q9YBPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084Q9YBPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":310145,"name":"Decorative Funny Kitchen Towels, Funny Housewarming Gifts for New Home Gift Ideas, New Grandma Gifts, Funny Dish Towels & Funny Tea Towels Kitchen | C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uHMyvfzXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add Some Personality to Your Kitchen! Do you want a funny way to display messages and cute sayings to your family and guests? Add novelty dish and hand towels with funny sayings to your kitchen, living space or bathroom. Your guests will love seeing your new messages and funny sayings. This design features multiple fonts to be extra engaging and eye catching. An Awesome Gift Do you need a fun house warming, apartment warming or new dorm gift? These towels are also great as stocking stuffers, bridal shower and even baby shower gifts! Medium Sized Dish Towel This towel measures 16 inches by 24 inches, which makes it large enough to be practical and display well without being too big. These are not tiny washcloth size towels, they’re meant to be displayed so guests and family can see the fun messages. 100% Cotton Traditional tea and dish towels were made from all natural cotton. Pure cotton towels are thin and convenient and display messages better than other materials. As a natural material they’re free from toxic chemicals and fabric conditioners. Join thousands of happy customers… Click Add-to-Cart to order your, “My Kitchen Was Clean Last Week Sorry You Missed It” dish towel Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uHMyvfzXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07PSC1GPZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PSC1GPZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PSC1GPZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":310146,"name":"wall26 - 3 Piece Canvas Wall Art - Rialto Bridge and Gondolas in Venice - Modern Home Art Stretched and Framed Ready to Hang - 16\"x24\"x3 Panels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DLmnjvoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High quality printed artwork stretched to fit on durable and shrink-resistant canvas. 3 pieces of set and each piece is 16\"x24\". Great gift idea for friends and family for holidays or other special occasions. 1.5\"\" stretcher bars to give artwork a gallery-quality profile. Hanging accessory toolkit included with all artwork. Note: Due to monitor display issues, actual colors may slightly differ from pictures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DLmnjvoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wall26","source_asin":"B09ZXT7G2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZXT7G2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZXT7G2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":310147,"name":"Herman Miller Classic Aeron Task Chair: Tilt Limiter w/Seat Angle Adj - PostureFit Support - Fully Adj Vinyl Arms - Standard Carpet Casters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":799.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713yHitPzcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exceeding all expectations and standards of its predecessors, the Aeron Chair, with its 12-year warranty, has become the new benchmark in the arena of ergonomic office seating. The innovative, now iconic design fits you and fits into your home. Instantly adaptable to all the motions you go through every day while seated, Aeron provides healthy comfort and balanced body support. An icon of modern design, the Aeron has earned a place in the permanent collection of the New York Museum of Modern Art. Features: Superior Ergonomics: The pioneering PostureFit mechanism supports the way your pelvis tilts naturally forward, so that your spine stays aligned and you avoid back pain. The Pellicle suspension conforms to your body, reduces pressure points, and provides unparalleled support. Be One With Your Chair: The patented Kinemat tilt mechanism lets your neck, shoulders, hips, knees, and ankles pivot naturally. Stay Cool: The unique breathable Pellicle suspension dissipates the body heat that builds up while you work, so it keeps you cool and comfortable. Stay Alert: The high, wide, contoured back takes the pressure off your lower spine. Armrests slope slightly down in the back for the most natural and comfortable support. The \"waterfall\" front edge of the seat takes the pressure off your thighs, so your blood keeps circulating and you stay alert and focused. Make Your Aeron Your Aeron: Nine easy-to-make adjustments let you make the Aeron chair work just right for the way you work. It's Got the Look: It fits right in, whether your home office is high-tech, elegant, casual, or a room that doubles as a gym. Green, No Matter What the Color: More than half of each chair is recycled materials, and the chair is 94 percent recyclable. Best in its class, the Aeron chair offers superior comfort, body support and style in a design that redefines the very meaning of “work chair.”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713yHitPzcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Herman Miller","source_asin":"B07CJF2HFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CJF2HFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CJF2HFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
