window.products.push({"id":310306,"name":"Caurbed Winter Duvet Cover Velvet Bedding King Size, Gray Crystal Duvet with 2 Pillowcases for Winter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XlVbq2KJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY CHOOSE CAURBED ? High Quality: The duvet cover is made of 100% crystal velvet fabric , so it is soft and cozy. It will make your bedroom a comfortable and refreshing place. Delightful Design: Solid color like a piece of brocade design lights up the room. The pattern of the front and back of the duvet cover add a touch of eclectic style to your bedroom. Gift Idea: This is an excellent gift to family or friends on Valentine’s Day, Mother's Day or Father's Day. It can also complement your room with this beautiful forward duvet cover. Item Contains 1x Duvet cover 2x Pillow shams Note: comforter sold separately ,not included in the set HOW TO PUT ON A DUVET COVER: THE TRADITIONAL WAY Step 1: Lay the comforter flat on top of your mattress. Step 2: Take your duvet cover and turn it inside out. Insert your hands inside and find the two top corners. You should now be holding one corner in each hand. Step 3: With your hands inside the duvet cover, reach down to grab hold of the comforter’s top two corners. Step 4: Holding the top two corners tightly, flip the duvet cover right side out over the comforter. Give it a shake and a fluff until the duvet cover falls down to cover most of the comforter. Step 5: Pull the duvet cover down. Stuff the bottom two corners of the comforter inside the bottom two corners of the duvet cover. Once everything is aligned, zip it up!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XlVbq2KJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caurbed","source_asin":"B08PK677XV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PK677XV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PK677XV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
