window.products.push({"id":310355,"name":"The Silicone Spatula | High Pure Odorless Silicone Material With Burn Proof and Stain Proof Technology | Colorful | Work with Ease Style | Dishwasher ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dce2fx91L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Premium Silicone Spatula Set : My Silicone Spatula(TM) is the best because it is odorless, nonstick, hygienic, and wont discolor, warp, melt or chip like your typical nylon or rubber spatulas. Its also burn-proof and stain-proof so you dont have to worry about having it melt when you put it in the microwave or oven handles let you work easily in different cooking situations, even in a heat because it is heat resistant up to 500F. Super Flexible Heads and Nonslip Grip : It comes in a compact design with 8.2 x 1.6 inches and gives the complete control over the movement of the spatula as well as you use the pressure. It is handy to use, and has a flexible curved head with an angle to reach crevices on your mixer, pan, and much more. Even better, the nice handle provides nonslip grip which fits comfortably in your hand and hence let you use it with ease. The Perfect Go-Tools for Your Cooking Needs : My Silicone Spatula(TM) will quickly become your go-to tools for mixing, folding, scraping, stirring, cooking, and even serving. With this, you can scrape jam from the jar, mix butter or use it while cooking something like scrambled eggs, yummy! This silicone spatula is definitely the true definition of kitchen hero. Effortless Cleaning in the Dishwasher : Its extremely easy to clean it. You can either wash it by hands or with the dishwasher. Rest assured, the heat from the water and dry cycle of the dishwasher will not damage this product. Get It Now : My Silicone Spatula(TM) comes in a set of 4 different color spatula; red, purple, blue, green. Each has loop for convenient storage. What are you waiting for! Get this ultimate kitchen item by placing your order now! [TAGS: silicone, spatula, heat, resistant, set, handle, scraper, spoon, kitchen, rubber, cook, flexible, cookware, tools]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dce2fx91L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"My Silicone Spatula","source_asin":"B0104MA50I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0104MA50I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0104MA50I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
