window.products.push({"id":310484,"name":"Huusk Meat Cleaver Knife with Sheath, Forged Full Tang Butcher Knife for Meat Cutting Black Viking Knife for Vegetables Cooking Knife for BBQ Camping ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t6HisVJuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Outstanding Sharpness and Strength: Our Camping Cooking Knife is precision forged from premium high carbon steel ATS-34 which makes the blade ultra solid and have a better ability to maintain sharp edge than stainless steel. The sharp edge is hand finished by expert bladesmiths to 12° per side with the traditional 3-step Honbazuke method. Nitrogen cooled for enhanced harness and flexibility. Unique Design - The chic, aggressive and muscular looking is inspired by Thor,black Titanium Nitride non-reflective armour not only endows it with mysterious charm, but also improves its robustness, corrosion resistance and enhancing non-stick properties. Coupled with an ultra sharp edge, it can be called the lightning that splits the night. It's sure to become a super star in your backyard barbecue. Excellent Grip: The ergonomic Oak handle is extensively tested, allowing you to slice with perfect control. By no means fatigue due to extended use prompted to the palm or wrist. The seamless Full-Tang design, which is different from the welded handles on the market, will not break even after long term use. Belt Sheath - A quality embossed sheath can protect the blade well and you can put it on a belt for easy carrying when camping outdoors. Huusk cleaver can easily slice, dice and mince meat, fish, vegetables, fruits,etc. It's ready to be your perfect assistant, whether indoors or outdoors! Guarantee - This collectible knife is well packaged in an exquisite gift box which is ideal for gift giving! Each Huusk knife goes through rigorous testing before every shipment. Also we provide 12-month warranty, 30-day free return without reason and friendly online customer service. No Risking shopping! Warm Tips: It is NOT dishwasher-safe and please clean and dry it immediately after each use. It will last a long lifetime with reasonable maintenance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t6HisVJuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huusk","source_asin":"B0BWTX8WS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWTX8WS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWTX8WS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
