window.products.push({"id":310631,"name":"KidKraft Medium Wooden Vanity & Stool - Pink, Children's Furniture, Kid's Bedroom Storage, Gift for Ages 3-8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W2TpHSXGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the KidKraft Medium Vanity & Stool, kids can get ready for the day in style. The classic design of this dressing table features elegant, tapered legs and scalloped trim around the mirror. A gliding drawer with pull knob is perfect for storing makeup, hair accessories, jewelry and more. The safety, shatterproof oval mirror is ideal for admiring jewelry, pretending to put on makeup or just practicing funny faces. Two elevated shelves let kids display their favorite small collectibles, lip gloss, or other necessities. The square wood stool has angled legs for extra stability. The durable pink finish and sturdy wood construction looks great in any bedroom or playroom for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W2TpHSXGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KidKraft","source_asin":"B0049OJX1U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0049OJX1U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0049OJX1U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":310632,"name":"TECHMILLY Super Soft Shaggy Bathroom Rugs, Absorbent Thick Non Slip Microfiber Bath Rugs, Quick Dry Machine Washable Bath Mat for Bathroom Floor, Bath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819FKUUOQAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WALKING ON THE CLOUD - Fluffy Plush Bath Rugs provides cloud-like softness as you step out of the shower. Crafted from the heavenly soft and substantial long-staple microfiber, these high-pile rugs feels amazing underfoot—almost like sherpa. So, instead of stepping onto a hard or cold floor, you'll be able to feel the unique comfort and welcoming warmth of a plush, luxurious bath mat instead. NEVER SLIDES ON THE FLOOR - The backing is made of notably grippy and protective TPR (thermoplastic rubber) which is highest quality non-slip and waterproof. Coming with free Rug Tapes for preventing rug sliding when the door is opened or rug corners curling, making your carpet hold down and keep it in place. Elderly and children even pets in your family can no longer have the possibility of slippimg. CATCH EVERY DROP OF WATER - When you're exiting the bath tub, shower, or getting ready by the sink, thick micro fabric helps to absorb water quick, keep your floors away dripping water. Moisture is trapped in the mat’s deep pile, allowing the rug to instant dry and be clean. CREATE YOUR OWN AREAS - Available in different colors and sizes which are easy to coordinate with other bath textiles and rooms. We love the idea of using small rugs to create “separate” areas in the bathroom—like placing one at the sink and one at the bathtub. It’ll make the space feel larger and homier. Runners are well-suited for elongated spaces, big or small. If your bathtub is across your shower area, you can place a bathroom runner in between to cover your base. EASY TO KEEP CLEAN AND FRESH - This mat is machine washable, but we recommends air-drying it to avoid warping the rubbery back. If your rug gets extra wet, just hang it rug up (over the bathtub’s side will work) and let it dry. Please make sure the floor is clean and dry before putting the mat back, this is helpful for long lasting use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819FKUUOQAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TECHMILLY","source_asin":"B0BWJCHLR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWJCHLR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWJCHLR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":310633,"name":"dulcidee Ivory Sheer Curtains 59 x 84 Inch Length 2 Panels Set - Lightweight and Light Filtering Elegant Rod Pocket Window Sheer Curtains for Bedroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J--hHeSDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Classic Sheer Curtains】DULCIDEE sheer curtains are made of high quality fabric with neat stitching and no extra threads. Our curtains, soft, light and breathable, is the most classic room decoration curtains & drapes, making your home look more elegant. 【Light Filtering & Privacy Protection】DULCIDEE sheer curtains are great \"light filter\". They will brighten up your room and add a soft finishing touch and breezy feel. While the sun pours into your room and the breeze flows in, you can still enjoy your beautiful garden view under a shade and your privacy is protected. 【Wider Panels & Various Sizes】Each package comes with 2 panels. Each panel's width is 59 inches which is wider than most of others in order to fit larger windows or have a fuller look. You'll love 59 inches wider panels to make your windows look more elegant and luxury! Also, they are available in a variety of lengths (45\", 54\", 63\", 72\", 84\", 96\", 108\", and 120\"). Different lengths and colors can be applied to bedrooms, living rooms, dining rooms, kid's rooms, offices and many other places. 【Easy to Install & Decorate】Top 2.5 inch wide rod pocket design makes this sheer curtain easier to hang and slide to accommodate more sizes of curtain rods. Also the bottom 3.5 inch pocket allows you to install bottom curtain rods as you need.They can also be paired with coordinating drapes to enhance its appeal as they will add a touch of luxury and exquisite to your home! 【Easy Care】Our quality sheer curtains will stand up to years of use and will not fade in the sun. Caring for this curtain is also easy: machine washable with cold or warm water, tumble dry and iron at low temperature, non-chlorine bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J--hHeSDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"dulcidee","source_asin":"B09CSV6Z3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CSV6Z3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CSV6Z3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
