window.products.push({"id":310655,"name":"Mothers Day Flowers Gift - Gift for Mom, Floral Shadow Box Wall Art, Rose 3D Butterfly Wall Décor Framed Wall Art, Birthday Gift, Gifts for Her (White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bgq8rtgSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"{The Gift That Says It All} Sometimes you need that multipurpose gift for mom, sister, or wife that covers every occasion. These wall accents are nice gifts for her, even for romantic events or holidays. The butterflies symbolize rebirth after death, so this framed wall art makes for thoughtful memorial gifts. Send this rose shadow box when words aren't enough to express how you feel {Free Standing Shelf Decor} The shadow box with flowers has a sawtooth hanger for easy mounting as bathroom or nursery butterfly wall art. Stand the rose shadow box on a table or shelf as a freestanding art display. Imagine the wall art decor hung in a clean white laundry room, placed on baby's dresser, or as a gorgeous addition as wall decor for little girls bedroom {Unique Handmade Gifts} All ~50 shadow box flowers are assembled carefully in a 7\"x7\" grid. The display case itself is a sturdy MDF with a fabric-cushioned backboard. The butterflies are made of no-shed, no-flake, water-resistant vinyl. Your new wall art for living room, bathroom, bedroom, study, or nursery will stand the test of time {Say it with Flowers & Butterflies} Sometimes you don't know what to say, and a thoughtful gift is the answer. Hang the wood wall decor up where you can remind someone of how much you care. Or give this butterfly wall art to someone special. The 3d butterfly wall decor works just as well as gifts for sympathy, Christmas gifts, birthday gifts for friends, baby shower gifts or housewarming gifts. {Many Colors to Choose From} The shadow flower box comes in so many different colors, there is a flower shadow box to fit any decor or popular nursery theme. Hang the flower wall decor in your little girls room, display the kitchen wall art where it's sure to elicit a smile, showcase the bathroom art on the countertop, or place in any room as shelf decor accents","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bgq8rtgSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heritage Hue","source_asin":"B08W4LZKD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W4LZKD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W4LZKD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
