window.products.push({"id":310748,"name":"Round Mother of Pearl Tray w Seagrass Handles | Woven Serving Tray for Coffee Table - Boho Decorative Platter - by MadeTerra (Floral)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719gsK40G3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE DECOR TRAY - The mother or pearl inlay bottom makes this faux seagrass serving tray a unique serveware and decorative piece for the dining table. The harmonious mixture of seagrass and sophisticated capiz shell inlaying patterns adds character and a luxury touch to many styles of decor. The artistic, moroccan - inspired inlaying pattern goes hand in hand with the classy vintage color and smooth, splinter-free finish of the tray, giving it an elegant appearance. VERSATILE - The mother of pearl seagrass tray could be used to serve food, breakfast, bread, snacks, drink, tea on coffee table. It is also a classy breakfast-in-bed tray for your enegertic days. This platter can also be used to display flowers, special ornaments, scented candles or create eye-catching table centerpieces for your dining parties. PREMIUM QUALITY - Our mother of pearl inlay serving and coffee trays are crafted by hand of Vietnamese artisans. It is light, made of all-weather faux seagrass and is hand made to last a long time. The tray is smartly built with strong handles so it could be carried around at ease, as a plus point. EASY TO CARRY - Our capiz shell wooden platter is flexible in use and could be carried around at ease thanks to two built-in handles. The tray is easy to pick up and rearrange without any troubles. HANDCRAFTED BY LOCAL ARTISANS - Our nacre - seagrass display tray, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Boi Khe, home to Vietnamese nacre inlaying arts. All of our products are handmade, so the actual pieces may vary slightly in color and size from the images shown online.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719gsK40G3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B09BNT1QGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BNT1QGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BNT1QGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
