window.products.push({"id":310875,"name":"Season’s Need 4ft Artificial Boxwood Spiral Topiary Plants, Indoor Entryway, Living Room or Covered Front Porch Home Decor, Faux Fake Plant Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":158.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U6wfrLFcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COST EFFECTIVE – Pack of 2 faux boxwood plants prove to be cost-effective in the long run. You save money on water bills, fertilizers, and replacements for withered or damaged plants. Additionally, artificial topiaries require minimal upkeep, which saves you time and effort. EVERGREEN BEAUTY - Artificial spiral topiary plants provide a year-round lush greenery that doesn't fade or wither like real plants. You can enjoy their vibrant and fresh appearance in any season, adding a touch of elegance and charm to your indoor or outdoor space. LOW MAINTENANCE - Unlike real plants, artificial boxwood topiaries require minimal care. You don't have to worry about watering, fertilizing, or pruning them regularly. This makes them an excellent choice for individuals who don't have a green thumb or are frequently away from home. VERSATILE - Artificial topiary trees are incredibly versatile when it comes to home decor. They can effortlessly enhance various settings, including living rooms, offices, patios, weddings, and events. With their classic appeal, they blend well with both traditional and contemporary styles, adding a touch of sophistication to any space. DURABLE - Artificial boxwood topiaries are made using high-quality materials that are designed to withstand the test of time. They are UV-resistant, fade-resistant, and weather-resistant, making them suitable for both indoor and outdoor use. You can enjoy their beauty for years without worrying about them losing their charm. ALLERGY FRIENDLY - If you or your loved ones suffer from allergies or sensitivities to pollen or other plant-related allergens, artificial topiaries are an ideal choice. Since they don't produce any pollen or release allergenic substances, they provide a safe and pleasant environment for everyone. AESTHETIC FARMOUSE DÉCOR - Faux boxwood topiaries offer all the aesthetic benefits of real plants without the maintenance hassles. They are a long-lasting investment that can elevate the beauty of your living or working environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U6wfrLFcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SN Decor","source_asin":"B0C3PTBNYX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3PTBNYX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3PTBNYX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
