window.products.push({"id":310878,"name":"Mom Blanket, Mom Blankets from Daughter Son, Birthday Gifts for Mom, for Mom, I Love You Mom Blanket Hug Presents for Dear Moms, Mother Soft Bed Flann","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yUn286M4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💕 THE BEST GIFT FOR MOM: Our soft and warm mom blanket is the perfect birthday gift for mom, and it's also a very popular christmas gift, mother's day gift,valentine's day gift, thanksgiving gift. Gift for mom when you're going somewhere far away from mom, written with words of love and gratitude, send this sweet letter to your dearest mom and let her drenched in love as her most cherished hug gift. 💕 HIGH QUALITY OF MOM BLANKET: Mom blanket size is 60\"x80\" (150CM x 200CM). Our blanket made from a premium ultra-soft micro fleece for ideal warmth and comfort, skin-friendly, soft and smooth, with a delicate touch. The blanket for mom is printed on one side. The mom throw blankets are fully dyed meaning their vibrant colors are embedded in every fiber, sturdy double edge stitching for a clean finish. 💕 VARIOUS SCENES: This mother blankets is suitable for all seasons and can be used both indoors and outdoors. Perfect for snuggling up on the couch watching TV, taking a nap at work or outdoors. This plush blanket can also turn into a perfect decoration for your home, bedroom, living room or kids room, and it can keep you warm if you are outdoors (camping, car, patio porch, etc.). Gifts for mom from daughter, gifts for mom from son meaningful. 💕 EASY TO CARE: This mom gift blanket is a useful gift that mom can use every day, lightweight, durable, anti-pilling, anti-wrinkle, no fading, no shedding, quick drying, easy to machine wash and tumble dry low. You can wash it with your favorite detergent, by machine washable or hand wash with room temperature water for a longer life and good texture. 💕 CUSTOMER SERVICE: We provide the mom blanket with an easy-to-carry storage bag, and a red bow ribbon. If you want your mom to cuddle herself in warmth, our air mail will be the right choice for you. Customer satisfaction is our pursuit. If you have any questions about our blankets, please contact us, we will reply you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yUn286M4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Biapian","source_asin":"B0BS3DC65N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS3DC65N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS3DC65N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
