window.products.push({"id":310938,"name":"AMOYSTONE 2-3 Lbs Small Agate Bookends 1 Pair Natural Crystal Dyed Pink Decorative Book Stopper for Books Movies Cds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s2B1OZe+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE:1 Pair. Size: 2-3 LBS. With rubber bumpers can be put on the bottom of bookends to protect your bookshelf or other furniture and NON-Slip Natural Agate: Made of natural agate stone and dyed pink with clothing dye, it is natural and harmless. There will be powder due to dyeing. In order to avoid staining your bookshelves or furniture, please wipe with a paper towel before use. The surface of agate has been polished smooth, but the back still retains the natural rough shell. Decoration:As bookends, the agate stones keep books, DVDs,CDs and movies up-right.In addition, it's also excellent decorations because of the unique color and pattern. You can put it in the living room, study or other places, it will give you a natural beauty. Healing:Agate is a grounding stone and have a powerful connection to the energies of the Earth. It is excellent for stabilizing our human electromagnetic fields andthe aura. It can also transmute negative energies and vibrations into positive waves that benefit our spiritual and emotional development. Unique:As a natural stone, every agate has the unique color, size, pattern and texture.And when we dye the agate stones pink, different stones are dyed in different shades of color.So you may receive one similar to the picture shown but not the same.Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions with your purchase","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s2B1OZe+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMOYSTONE","source_asin":"B09BVC1L4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-310938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BVC1L4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BVC1L4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
